        <mxCell id="subheading" value="Turns raw counterfactual pairs into an EAP-IG dataset of (clean, corrupted) prompt pairs with matching-length correct/incorrect label token ids. Two variants: the MVP/AOS pipeline (&lt;i&gt;[A] [O] [S]&lt;/i&gt; markers, five tag orders) and the simpler GAS pipeline (&lt;i&gt;sentence =&amp;gt; ( a | o | s )&lt;/i&gt;)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="64" width="1000" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
